### Task Management API — Projects
# Each resource file logs in independently (REST Client variables are file-scoped).

@contentType = {{contentType}}

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### List projects (paged) — filters: status=Active|Completed|Archived, search=
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&status=Active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a project — captures its id
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "REST Client Project",
  "description": "Created from projects.http"
}

###
@projectId = {{createProject.response.body.$.id}}

### Get one project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a project (status: Active|Completed|Archived)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "REST Client Project (renamed)",
  "description": "Updated from projects.http",
  "status": "Active"
}

### Tasks in a project (same filters as /api/tasks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Project statistics (needs reports:view — Manager/Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a project (409 if it still has active tasks)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
